<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>MIT6.1810 on Minghan的博客</title><link>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/categories/mit6.1810/</link><description>Recent content in MIT6.1810 on Minghan的博客</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:01:51 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://Jiangmmh.github.io/categories/mit6.1810/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>MIT6.1810: Lab3 Pagetable</title><link>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/xv6-lab3-pgtbl/</link><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:01:51 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/xv6-lab3-pgtbl/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="一inspect-a-user-process-page-tableeasy">一、&lt;strong>Inspect a user-process page table (easy)&lt;/strong>·&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>xv6提供了一个用户程序pgtbltest.c，其中调用print_pgtbl()打印了页表的前10个页面和后10页的页表项，因为页表属于内核管理的数据结构，所以想要获取页表项就必须通过系统调用才行。在该lab中xv6额外提供了几个系统调用，其中的pgpte()的作用就是根据虚拟地址va，得到其对应的PTE。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-c" data-lang="c">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">ugetpid&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="n">uint64&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">pgpte&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">vmprint&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">pgaccess&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">base&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">mask&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">ksupernpte&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">uint64&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">uint64&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-c" data-lang="c">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nf">print_pgtbl&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">printf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;print_pgtbl starting&lt;/span>&lt;span class="se">\n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">for&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">uint64&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;lt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">10&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">++&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">print_pte&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">PGSIZE&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">uint64&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">top&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">MAXVA&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">/&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">PGSIZE&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">for&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">uint64&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">top&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">10&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;lt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">top&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">++&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">print_pte&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">PGSIZE&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">printf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;print_pgtbl: OK&lt;/span>&lt;span class="se">\n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>启动xv6，运行程序pgtbltest打印页表：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">xv6 kernel is booting
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">hart &lt;span class="m">1&lt;/span> starting
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">hart &lt;span class="m">2&lt;/span> starting
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">init: starting sh
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$ pgtbltest
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">print_pgtbl starting
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x0 pte 0x21FC885B pa 0x87F22000 perm 0x5B
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x1000 pte 0x21FC7C17 pa 0x87F1F000 perm 0x17
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x2000 pte 0x21FC7807 pa 0x87F1E000 perm 0x7
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3000 pte 0x21FC74D7 pa 0x87F1D000 perm 0xD7
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x4000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x5000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x6000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x7000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x8000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x9000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFF6000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFF7000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFF8000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFF9000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFFA000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFFB000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFFC000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFFD000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFFE000 pte 0x21FD08C7 pa 0x87F42000 perm 0xC7
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFFF000 pte 0x2000184B pa 0x80006000 perm 0x4B
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">print_pgtbl: OK
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">vmprint_test starting
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">vmprint_test: &lt;span class="k">done&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">pgaccess_test starting
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">pgtbltest: pgaccess_test failed: incorrect access bits set, &lt;span class="nv">pid&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="m">3&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>这个页表和用户进程的地址空间正好能对应上：&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>MIT6.1810: Lab2 Syscall</title><link>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/xv6-lab2-syscall/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:23:20 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/xv6-lab2-syscall/</guid><description>&lt;p>在这个lab中我们将深入理解xv6（其他系统也差不多）的系统调用是如何实现的，并尝试根据功能需求实现自己的系统调用。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>关于xv6的概述和系统调用的逻辑可以看&lt;a href="https://jiangmmh.github.io/posts/xv6-01/">这篇文章&lt;/a>，后面就不过多介绍了。&lt;/p>
&lt;h1 id="一using-gdbeasy">一、&lt;strong>Using gdb (easy)&lt;/strong>&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>这部分内容主要是介绍gdb的使用方法，略。&lt;/p>
&lt;h1 id="二sandbox-a-commandmoderate">二、&lt;strong>Sandbox a command(moderate)&lt;/strong>&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>题目要求实现一个系统调用interpose，其接受两个参数：一个整数掩码和一个路径，前者指定了要屏蔽哪些系统调用，后者暂时不用管。如果要使用interpose屏蔽当前进程的open系统调用，用法如下：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-c" data-lang="c">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nf">interpose&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">SYS_open&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;-&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>现在开始实现该系统调用，首先是用户侧：&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>在 user/user.h 中添加 interpose() 的声明 。
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>int interpose(int, const char *);&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>在 user/usys.pl 中添加一行内容用于生成系统调用入口函数的实现。
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>entry(&amp;ldquo;interpose&amp;rdquo;);&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>题目提供了两个程序sandbox.c和sbtest.c，我们需要在Makefile中将其加入编译：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-makefile" data-lang="makefile">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nv">UPROGS&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> ......
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nv">$U&lt;/span>/_sandbox&lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="se">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">$U&lt;/span>/_sbtest&lt;span class="se">\
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>在内核侧：&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>在 kernel/syscall.h 中添加 interpose 的系统调用号宏定义&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>#define SYS_interpose 23&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>在 kernel/proc.h 的proc结构体中添加一个interpose_mask，记录屏蔽字&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>int interpose_mask;&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>在 kernel/sysproc.c 中添加函数 sys_interpose() 处理interpose系统调用&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-c" data-lang="c">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="n">uint64&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nf">sys_interpose&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">interpose_mask&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">argint&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">interpose_mask&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">myproc&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">interpose_mask&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">interpose_mask&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>为了使子进程能够继承父进程的屏蔽字，需要在创建子进程时拷贝interpose_mask，在 kernel/proc.c 中的 kfork() 函数的末尾添加 interpose_mask 的拷贝。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>MIT6.1810: Lab1 Utils</title><link>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/xv6-lab1-util/</link><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 15:12:01 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/xv6-lab1-util/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="一环境准备">一、环境准备&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>环境配置见&lt;a href="https://pdos.csail.mit.edu/6.1810/2026/tools.html">文档&lt;/a>，Linux和Mac皆可。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>拉取实验代码：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$ git clone git://g.csail.mit.edu/xv6-labs-2026
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">Cloning into &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;xv6-labs-2026&amp;#39;&lt;/span>...
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">...
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$ &lt;span class="nb">cd&lt;/span> xv6-labs-2026
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>项目中已经提供了Makefile，直接构建并通过qemu启动即可：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$ make qemu
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">riscv64-unknown-elf-gcc -c -o kernel/entry.o kernel/entry.S
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">riscv64-unknown-elf-gcc -Wall -Werror -O -fno-omit-frame-pointer -ggdb -DSOL_UTIL -MD -mcmodel&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>medany -ffreestanding -fno-common -nostdlib -mno-relax -I. -fno-stack-protector -fno-pie -no-pie -c -o kernel/start.o kernel/start.c
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">...
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">riscv64-unknown-elf-ld -z max-page-size&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="m">4096&lt;/span> -N -e main -Ttext &lt;span class="m">0&lt;/span> -o user/_zombie user/zombie.o user/ulib.o user/usys.o user/printf.o user/umalloc.o
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">riscv64-unknown-elf-objdump -S user/_zombie &amp;gt; user/zombie.asm
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">riscv64-unknown-elf-objdump -t user/_zombie &lt;span class="p">|&lt;/span> sed &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;1,/SYMBOL TABLE/d; s/ .* / /; /^$/d&amp;#39;&lt;/span> &amp;gt; user/zombie.sym
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">mkfs/mkfs fs.img README user/xargstest.sh user/_cat user/_echo user/_forktest user/_grep user/_init user/_kill user/_ln user/_ls user/_mkdir user/_rm user/_sh user/_stressfs user/_usertests user/_grind user/_wc user/_zombie
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">nmeta &lt;span class="m">46&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">(&lt;/span>boot, super, log blocks &lt;span class="m">30&lt;/span> inode blocks 13, bitmap blocks 1&lt;span class="o">)&lt;/span> blocks &lt;span class="m">954&lt;/span> total &lt;span class="m">1000&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">balloc: first &lt;span class="m">591&lt;/span> blocks have been allocated
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">balloc: write bitmap block at sector &lt;span class="m">45&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">qemu-system-riscv64 -machine virt -bios none -kernel kernel/kernel -m 128M -smp &lt;span class="m">3&lt;/span> -nographic -drive &lt;span class="nv">file&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>fs.img,if&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>none,format&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>raw,id&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>x0 -device virtio-blk-device,drive&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>x0,bus&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>virtio-mmio-bus.0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">xv6 kernel is booting
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">hart &lt;span class="m">2&lt;/span> starting
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">hart &lt;span class="m">1&lt;/span> starting
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">init: starting sh
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>关于xv6项目目录结构、构建流程和Boot细节，可以看我的这篇&lt;a href="https://jiangmmh.github.io/posts/xv6-01/">文章&lt;/a>。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>